---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - Vasudhaiva Kulam">
  <main class="grow bg-background py-12 md:py-20">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-gutter text-center mb-10">
      <h1
        class="font-display text-headline-md md:text-display-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-4"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        Effective Date: September 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Policy Content Document -->
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div
        class="bg-surface rounded-xl shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,128,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/30 p-8 md:p-12 backdrop-blur-xl"
      >
        <p
          class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-8"
        >
          This privacy policy outlines how our NGO collects, uses, and protects
          the personal information of individuals who sign up as volunteers
          through our website.
        </p>

        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4"
          >
            We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us
            when you express interest in volunteering. This includes:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant ml-4"
          >
            <li><strong>Full Name</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Email Address</strong></li>
            <li>
              Any additional details you choose to provide in contact or
              application forms (such as phone numbers, areas of interest, or
              availability).
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4"
          >
            The information we collect is used exclusively for operational and
            communication purposes related to our NGO's activities, including:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant ml-4"
          >
            <li>
              Contacting you regarding volunteer opportunities, events, and
              projects.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sending periodic updates, newsletters, or impact reports about our
              organization's work.
            </li>
            <li>Managing our volunteer database and coordinating schedules.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            Data Sharing and Disclosure
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4"
          >
            We respect your privacy. We do not sell, trade, or rent your
            personal information to third parties. We may share your data only
            under the following limited circumstances:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant ml-4"
          >
            <li>
              When required by law, subpoena, or legal process to protect our
              rights, safety, or the safety of others.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            Data Security
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
          >
            We implement appropriate technical and organizational security
            measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized
            access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method
            of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is
            completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            Your Choices and Rights
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4"
          >
            You have control over your personal data at any time. You can:
          </p>
          <dl class="space-y-4 font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
              <dt class="font-semibold text-on-surface min-w-[120px]">
                Access or Update:
              </dt>
              <dd>
                Request to view, correct, or update the personal information we
                hold about you.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
              <dt class="font-semibold text-on-surface min-w-[120px]">
                Deletion:
              </dt>
              <dd>
                Request the complete removal of your contact information from
                our active volunteer database.
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            Children's Privacy
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
          >
            Our volunteer opportunities are not intentionally directed at
            individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect
            personal information from children under 13 without verifiable
            parental consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-display text-title-sm font-semibold text-on-surface mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"
          >
            Changes to This Privacy Policy
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
          >
            We may update this privacy policy from time to time to reflect
            changes in our practices or legal requirements. Any updates will be
            posted directly on this page with a revised effective date.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
